  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technological Innovation Strategy in Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The educational authorities of the new Government in Guatemala 2024-2027 have requested technical support from UNESCO to implement the Technological Innovation and Digital Inclusion Strategy that seeks to improve the quality of digital educational programs. Likewise, the Strategy will seek to modernize governance and management processes of the Ministry of Education for its agile and protected implementation. This support will be aligned to UNESCO Strategy on Technological Innovation in Education (2022-2025) and guided by the humanistic vision to the use of technology.</narrative>
  </description>
